" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 19.1.5(i)–(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"571–572"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"591–592"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArrayComputable},\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{ArrayComputable},\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b0323b86d2825eb9\" href=\"?note=b0323b86d2825eb9\" title=\"43-df-array-computable\">43-df-array-computable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KummerComplex}\">\\(\\operatorname{KummerComplex}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"09df50f7db3de7ca\" href=\"?note=09df50f7db3de7ca\" title=\"43-df-kummer-complex\">43-df-kummer-complex</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Order}\">\\(\\operatorname{Order}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a>。集合按特征序列取初段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}(A)\\iff\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(B\\equiv_TA\\land\\operatorname{KummerComplex}(B)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}(A)\\iff\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(B\\equiv_TA\\land\\operatorname{KummerComplex}(B)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArrayComputable}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Order}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le\\log_2n+f(n)+c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ArrayComputable}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Order}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le\\log_2n+f(n)+c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>KummerComplex 已在本目录依据定理 (iii)(a) 使用存在固定亏损常数的机器不变版本。本项不回到草稿 Definition 19.1.3 的 for each d 排印冲突。阵列可计算一侧允许每个无界可计算非递减 f 分别拥有常数 c。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 19.1.5(i)–(ii)，印刷页 571–572，PDF 页 591–592。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]